OL,3,ATrump says he will stop using taxpayer
OL,4,Afunds for ads after bipartisan pushback
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresident Donald Trump has said he will
OL,7,Fstop using US taxpayer funds to pay for
OL,8,Ftelevision ads he has fronted,
OL,9,Ffollowing bipartisan pushback.
OL,11,F"The Radical Left is upset with the
OL,12,Ffact that I am taking Ads, which I
OL,13,Fconsider to be a positive promotion for
OL,14,Four Great U.S.A., and paying for them
OL,15,Fwith U.S.A. money," he said Monday on
OL,16,Fsocial media.
OL,18,FTrump said it is "a rather standard
OL,19,Fthing to do" but that he has decided to
OL,20,Fpay for the "Patriotic Ads" himself and
OL,21,Fwith money he raised through his MAGA
OL,22,FInc super political action committee.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
